  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ea0f5658-f12f-54dc-9c0c-2d08166961ac" activityNameId="67495161-05f2-5ffb-9e7d-6eec9f4cba86" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, PP-HM pipe, SN 16, DN 300, profile 1</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, PP-HM pipe, SN 16, DN 300, profile 1
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 6b134c4b-c98b-45e1-bd10-a415e8f2af9b
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with PP-HM pipe. SN 16, DN 300, profile 1 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with PP-HM pipe, DN 300, profile 1. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: SN 16, DN 300, profile 1 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. PP-HM pipe, ID 286 mm, outer diameter 315 mm, wall thickness 14 mm, 12 kg/m, 930 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6b134c4b-c98b-45e1-bd10-a415e8f2af9b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
